<title>FRANCE: Bertrand Faure H1 results rise.</title>
<headline>Bertrand Faure H1 results rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   175.8  vs	   129.6</p>
<p>    Net					    207.5  vs	   147.0</p>
<p>    Operating				    396.7  vs	   360.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 336.6  vs	   250.1</p>
<p>    Turnover				   7,223.1  vs	 6,601.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Bertrand Faure reported its half-year results in a statement. It said 1995 results were restated to integrate Tecnoconfort and its subsidiaries, acquired at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>It said cashflow was 465.5 million francs and industrial investments totalled 254.6 million. Net debt declined by 241.7 million francs since the end of 1995 to 2.28 billion.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
